# Do not delete. python/pyproject.toml force-includes
# src/apx_agent/_builder_ui_dist into the wheel, so this directory MUST exist on
# a fresh clone or `uv sync` fails the editable build with:
#   FileNotFoundError: Forced include not found: .../_builder_ui_dist
# The actual visual-builder SPA bundle is built by `make builder-ui` (see the
# sibling .gitignore) — only this placeholder is tracked.
